      "description": "Watch Zulte Waregem vs Genk highlights and goals from Jupiler Pro League on ReFooty: Football Highlights Hub. Match played on August 10, 2026. The Jupiler Pro League intensity reached new heights on August 10, 2026, as Zulte Waregem hosted Genk in a fixture defined by shifting momentum and clinical finishing. Both sides sought to establish dominance in a match where patience and late-game execution would ultimately prove decisive. Genk Take the Initiative The contest began with both teams testing each other's resolve, but it was Genk who broke the deadlock late in the first half. In the 39th minute, Junya Ito showcased his creative flair, providing a pinpoint assist for Rafiu Durosinmi , who clinicaly slotted the ball home to give the visitors the lead. Zulte Waregem struggled to find an immediate response, and their frustration was evident when Daan Heymans received a yellow card just minutes before the halftime whistle. At the break, the visitors held a deserved but narrow advantage. A Stunning Four-Minute Turnaround The second half saw Zulte Waregem emerge with renewed purpose, despite an early booking for Anosike Ementa . As the game entered its final stages, the home side’s persistence finally paid off. In the 82nd minute, Marley Ake found space in the box and fired home a crucial equalizer, shifting the psychological balance of the match. The momentum stayed firmly with the hosts, and just four minutes later, the comeback was complete. Anosike Ementa turned provider in the 86th minute, setting up substitute Serxho Ujka , who made no mistake in putting Zulte Waregem ahead for the first time. Genk 's attempts to salvage a point were hampered by late bookings for Christian Akpan and Yaimar Medina as the visitors lost their discipline. The final whistle confirmed a remarkable victory for the home side, leaving the fans in celebration after a dramatic conclusion."
